# GM21.1 / GM07.1 / schema0.2.0 +0021. No secrets in repository.
# Root/mobile npm ci; backend:start. Real reproducible suite:
# GM21_PYTHON=python3 node scripts/gm21_http_check.mjs
# Runner uses owned disposable DB/PostgREST and real GoTrue test guests.
# For app DB, apply0021 via reviewed local migration; no DB reset.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321
@publicKey = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PUBLIC_KEY
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_GOTRUE_GUEST_ACCESS_TOKEN
@historyId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_HISTORY_UUID

### Authenticated history. <=50 rows, newest finalizedAt/id first.
# 200 {ok:true,data:[HistoryItem]}; no raw roster/groupKey/consent/GPS/ballot.
# Scope group checks every scoped consent; cursor is last returned item.id.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_history
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":"personal","cursor":null}

### Enable consent for future meals. No retrospective history/grant after start.
# Request ID is opaque GM07 string. Same ID/body -> same ACK, no repeated write.
# Same ID/different body ->409 REQUEST_ID_REUSED. 200 void data:null.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/update_history_consent
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_history_example_enable","scope":"personal","consent":true}

### Group withdrawal. Physically removes affected group summaries.
# 200 void. Peers personal summaries/result/winner are unchanged.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/update_history_consent
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_history_example_group_off","scope":"group","consent":false}

### Own personal or member group deletion. No global result/peer personal delete.
# Missing/other-owner UUID is the same successful no-op, no existence oracle.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/delete_history
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_history_example_delete","history_id":"{{historyId}}"}

### Missing JWT ->401. Forged JWT also401; another valid caller sees only own rows.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_history
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":"group","cursor":null}
